<Item XName="Notes" UserName="Notes" Type="Notes">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>1</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt; &lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;DIV style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-element: para-border-div; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt&quot;&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; TEXT-ALIGN: center; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid windowtext .75pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 1.0pt 0cm&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;Channelized&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/DIV&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue Example Workspace&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;Simulation Task&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;This example contains 3 designs. The ChannelizedRx design demonstrates a full band wideband digital receiver based on channelized technique which includes polyphase filter and FFT. The ChannelizedTx design demonstrates one multi-channels transmitter which is composed of channelized polyphase structure and FFT technique. The ChannelizedTxRx design demonstrates one multi-channels transmitter and one channelized receiver. The wideband channelized transmitter and wideband channelized receiver are widely used in the EW field.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;Workspace Description&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 10pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;************************************************&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;In the ChannelizedRx design, the receiver works at 1.024GSps, so it can receive the signals in the band from 0-500MHz simultaneously. The full band is divided into 8 sub-channels, each channel&apos;s filter characteristics are:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;1. -1dB bandwidth: 64MHz&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;2. -40dB bandwidth: 128MHz&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;3. ripple in passband: &amp;lt;0.1dB&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;4. stopband attenuation: &amp;gt;40dB&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;5. Filter length is 255(coefficient number is 256)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;The input signal is 10MHz real signal, so the spectrum of output includes two spectral lines at 1344 and 704 position.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;The frequency of output signal computation is as follows:1.024e9/8/4096 * (1344-704)/2 = 10e6;(The sampling rate is 1.024Gsps, the observation length is 4096 samples) &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;In the ChannelizedTx design, there is one top level design in this workspace:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 42.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;l&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;This structure is a standard multi-channels digital polyphase channelized transmitter structure.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 42.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;l&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;To transmit 8 channel signals (the channels number can be up to thousands).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt 42.25pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 0; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Wingdings; mso-fareast-font-family: Wingdings; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: Wingdings&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;l&lt;SPAN style=&apos;FONT: 7pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;The channelized filter uses the polyphase structure to decrease the computing resource.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;The output will show the 8 channels spectrum diagram. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=left&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;In the ChannelizedTxRx design, there&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;one top level design&amp;nbsp;which includes one channelized transmitter and one channelized&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;receiver in this workspace. The spectrum of the output of transmitter and receiver can be observed with spectrum diagram and VSA 89600.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;[1] &lt;/SPAN&gt;International Conference in Communications, Signal Processing, and Systems CSPS 2017: Communications, Signal Processing, and Systems pp 1245-1252;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-US style=&apos;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: SimSun; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: ZH-CN; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA&apos;&gt;[2] Jeffrey H. Reed, Software Radio A Modern Approach to Radio Engineering-Prentice Hall (2002)&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;</Text>
